  "description": "<p>The Juicy Goddesses is a sustainability focused, no-harm line of high quality women's clothing and jewellery designed to help empower women to release their inner Juicy Goddess. Flowing through life with passion, elegance, playfulness and beauty, a Juicy Goddess is an inspiration and a delight to all around her. With the long overdue and dearly needed global rise of the Divine Feminine, The Juicy Goddesses aims to help conscious women dress the way the feel inside.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>In the near future we also plan to expand into many other areas, including women-focused education, retreats, online workshops, women's circles, online female anatomy courses and more. We offer with love to all, and invite you on this journey with us.</p>\r\n<p>At present we offer our Affilates 10% Commission on every sale they bring in on any clothing item using your affilate links or codes. These links and codes will offer 10% off of any of any clothing items in the store. So it's a true Win Win for all!&nbsp;<br><br>Welcome to the Juicy Goddesses!&nbsp;</p>",
